      "created_at": "2013-05-17T02:29:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Dear &gt;G,</p><p>During the Kickstarter, we saw a lot of stuff. We saw pilots, we saw Opposition, we saw flagships, we saw Strike Force ships. &nbsp;What we didn't see was sectors, except for the Oothagos Expanse of course (and the existence of Vognild Prime, though that one had no rules). How come that is? Are they not as ready as the rest of the stuff? They seem to be one of the simpler components in the game, but maybe they're really complicated?</p><p>If the answer is just that there wasn't enough time during the Kickstarter to reveal sectors along with everything else (to which I say, \"nuh uh\"), maybe we could get those awesome reveals now, here, maybe even in this topic you're reading at this very moment? That'd be sweet.</p>",
